 up to whole G in MHPCO's favor\n20. should round final payout down to whole G in MHPCO's favor\n21. should apply 100 G deductible per damage event\n22. should cap total payout per policy at twice the insurance sum\n23. should reimburse 50% of damage for items with enchantment level ≥ 8\n24. should fully reimburse damage to items made of dragon material\n25. should apply both high-enchantment and dragon-material clauses with high-enchantment winning (dragon-material sword, enchantment 9, damage 1000 G → payout 400 G)\n26. should apply only dragon-material clause when enchantment < 8 (dragon"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784950773149,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-5e4914ff-9c8f-4fd6-ac90-cfd58ff8a7da","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"}}
