{"type":"message_update","assistantMessageEvent":{"type":"text_delta","contentIndex":0,"delta":"\n29.","partial":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Test List\n\nTest List Created:\n**Feature**: MHPCO Claim Office\n**Test File**: src/claim-office.spec.ts\n**Tests**: 31\n\n**Test Cases** (ordered simple -> complex):\n1. should handle empty item list → premium 5 G (only the processing fee)\n2. should reject unknown item type in quote with error\n3. should compute base premium for a sword: 100 G\n4. should compute base premium for an amulet: 60 G\n5. should compute base premium for a staff: 80 G\n6. should compute base premium for a potion: 40 G\n7. should compute base premium for components: 25 G each\n8. should apply building block of 3 alike components: 60 G base premium\n9. should not apply building block for 4 runes: 100 G base premium\n10. should not apply building block for different types (2 runes + 1 moonstone → 75 G)\n11. should apply two separate blocks for 3 runes + 3 moonstones → 120 G\n12. should add 50% risk surcharge for cursed items\n13. should add 30% risk surcharge for highly enchanted items (enchantment level ≥ 5)\n14. should apply cursed surcharge only to the affected item's base premium\n15. should apply loyalty discount of 20% for long-standing customers (≥ 2 years)\n16. should apply first insurance surcharge of 10% on each contract\n17. should apply 15% discount on each contract after the first\n18. should add 5 G processing fee to every premium\n19. should round final premium up to whole G in MHPCO's favor\n20. should round final payout down to whole G in MHPCO's favor\n21. should apply 100 G deductible per damage event\n22. should cap total payout per policy at twice the insurance sum\n23. should reimburse 50% of damage for items with enchantment level ≥ 8\n24. should fully reimburse damage to items made of dragon material\n25. should apply both high-enchantment and dragon-material clauses with high-enchantment winning (dragon-material sword, enchantment 9, damage 1000 G → payout 400 G)\n26. should apply only dragon-material clause when enchantment < 8 (dragon-material sword, enchantment 5, damage 800 G → payout 700 G)\n27. should apply only high-enchantment clause for steel sword, enchantment 9, damage 1000 G → payout 400 G\n28. should reject claim with non-zero exit code if damages exceed insured items\n29."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784950773149,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-5e4914ff-9c8f-4fd6-ac90-cfd58ff8a7da","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"}},"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Test List\n\nTest List Created:\n**Feature**: MHPCO Claim Office\n**Test File**: src/claim-office.spec.ts\n**Tests**: 31\n\n**Test Cases** (ordered simple -> complex):\n1. should handle empty item list → premium 5 G (only the processing fee)\n2. should reject unknown item type in quote with error\n3. should compute base premium for a sword: 100 G\n4. should compute base premium for an amulet: 60 G\n5. should compute base premium for a staff: 80 G\n6. should compute base premium for a potion: 40 G\n7. should compute base premium for components: 25 G each\n8. should apply building block of 3 alike components: 60 G base premium\n9. should not apply building block for 4 runes: 100 G base premium\n10. should not apply building block for different types (2 runes + 1 moonstone → 75 G)\n11. should apply two separate blocks for 3 runes + 3 moonstones → 120 G\n12. should add 50% risk surcharge for cursed items\n13. should add 30% risk surcharge for highly enchanted items (enchantment level ≥ 5)\n14. should apply cursed surcharge only to the affected item's base premium\n15. should apply loyalty discount of 20% for long-standing customers (≥ 2 years)\n16. should apply first insurance surcharge of 10% on each contract\n17. should apply 15% discount on each contract after the first\n18. should add 5 G processing fee to every premium\n19. should round final premium up to whole G in MHPCO's favor\n20. should round final payout down to whole G in MHPCO's favor\n21. should apply 100 G deductible per damage event\n22. should cap total payout per policy at twice the insurance sum\n23. should reimburse 50% of damage for items with enchantment level ≥ 8\n24. should fully reimburse damage to items made of dragon material\n25. should apply both high-enchantment and dragon-material clauses with high-enchantment winning (dragon-material sword, enchantment 9, damage 1000 G → payout 400 G)\n26. should apply only dragon-material clause when enchantment < 8 (dragon-material sword, enchantment 5, damage 800 G → payout 700 G)\n27. should apply only high-enchantment clause for steel sword, enchantment 9, damage 1000 G → payout 400 G\n28. should reject claim with non-zero exit code if damages exceed insured items\n29."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784950773149,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-5e4914ff-9c8f-4fd6-ac90-cfd58ff8a7da","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"}}
