nt winning (dragon-material sword, enchantment 9, damage 1000 G → payout 400 G)\n26. should apply only dragon-material clause when enchantment < 8 (dragon-material sword, enchantment 5, damage 800 G → payout 700 G)\n27. should apply only high-enchantment clause for steel sword, enchantment 9, damage 1000 G → payout 400 G\n28. should reject claim with non-zero exit code if damages exceed insured items\n29. should reject claim with negative damage amount\n30. should reject quote with negative values\n31. should handle multiple items of the same type (two swords → insurance sum 2000 G)\n32. should apply deductible per damaged item (dragon attack damages sword and amulet → deductible applies twice)\n33. should reduce payout when cap is exhausted (first claim 1400 G, second claim 600 G of requested 1400 G)\n34. should base cap on unmodified insurance value (cursed sword insurance value 1000 G → cap 2000 G)\n35. should include component insurance value in total sum"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"requesty","model":"nebius/qwen/qwen3-235b-a22b-instruct-2507","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1784950773149,"responseId":"rqsty-cmpl-5e4914ff-9c8f-4fd6-ac90-cfd58ff8a7da","responseModel":"Qwen/Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507"}},"message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"## Test List\n\nTest List Created:\n**Feature**: MHPCO Claim Office\n**Test File**: src/claim-office.spec.ts\n**Tests**: 31\n\n**Test Cases** (ordered simple -> complex):\n1. should handle empty item list → premium 5 G (only the processing fee)\n2. should reject unknown item type in quote with error\n3. should compute base premium for a sword: 100 G\n4. should compute base premium for an amulet: 60 G\n5. should compute base premium for a staff: 80 G\n6. should compute base premium for a potion: 40 G\n7. should compute base premium for componen